    This project was originally derived from portions of the CadQuery codebase
    (https://github.com/CadQuery/cadquery) but has since been extensively
    refactored and restructured into an independent system.
    CadQuery is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Statement of changes: Caddy re-implements build123d 0.13.0's algebraic API in TypeScript. Python
modules were rewritten as TypeScript classes and functions with JavaScript naming (camelCase),
Python operators were replaced by named methods, the builder/context-manager API was omitted, and
the OCP (Python) kernel bindings were replaced by the native @roonieone/occt-native package.

